{"id":"wb-4-221","name":"张学良旧居","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"张学良旧居","text":"张学良旧居，通称张氏帅府，又称为大帅府、少帅府，位于中华人民共和国沈阳市沈河区朝阳街少帅府巷48号，是中华民国大陆时期奉系军阀张作霖及其子张学良的官邸，也是国家AAAA级旅游景区。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%BC%A0%E5%AD%A6%E8%89%AF%E6%97%A7%E5%B1%85","revisionId":94097428,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94097428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/d143558b5baf3917667c34a1.jpg","title":"沈阳张氏帅府大青楼2024.10_(2).jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B2%88%E9%98%B3%E5%BC%A0%E6%B0%8F%E5%B8%85%E5%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E9%9D%92%E6%A5%BC2024.10_(2).jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0c/%E6%B2%88%E9%98%B3%E5%BC%A0%E6%B0%8F%E5%B8%85%E5%BA%9C%E5%A4%A7%E9%9D%92%E6%A5%BC2024.10_%282%29.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"ScareCriterion12","license":"CC0","licenseUrl":"http://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/deed.en","caption":"​沈阳市沈河区 张氏帅府（张学良旧居）","width":320,"height":263}}